cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Benchtop ELN in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Benchtop ELN"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source electronic lab notebook for synthetic chemistry that runs on the lab's own computer:
  reaction drawing with stoichiometry, in-browser NMR processing, a chemical inventory, author-and-witness
  signatures with trusted timestamps, .eln exchange with other notebooks, and archival PDF/A exports.
authors:
  - given-names: Jules
    family-names: Lafargue
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/juleslafargue/benchtop-eln"
url: "https://juleslafargue.github.io/benchtop-eln/"
keywords:
  - electronic lab notebook
  - ELN
  - synthetic chemistry
  - NMR
  - research data management
  - open science
